-- COCOON v3.9 — Continuous concurrent Hold/Place/Eject + direct feed
-- - NON-STOP: repeats passes over all players+pets until button OFF
-- - 2 workers (game cap: 2 held objects)
-- - Explicit HoldBaby after every pet furniture use (SimpleSpy-style)
-- - Explicit EjectBaby on stop/finish
-- - Movement-verified detach still used as a safety check
-- - NEW: Feed/drink = ensure inventory (buy fallback) -> equip tool
--        -> PetObjectAPI/CreatePetObject (PetObjectCreatorType_2)
--        NO MORE routing pets to f-24 / f-9 furniture.
-- ==================================================================
